  Let q: Path(X,t,y,z)
  Returns: Path(X,t,x,z)
  Means: @Path.trans X t x y z p q
  Render latex: {p} * {q}

Define reverse twice(t,x,y,p):
  Let X: Type
  Let t: Topology(X)
  Let x,y: X
  Let p: Path(X,t,x,y)
  Returns: Path(X,t,x,y)
